down directly to person

00:00:47.220 --> 00:00:49.140
is it's good and bad at the same time.

00:00:49.140 --> 00:00:51.570
Good in that you're dousing the flame,

00:00:51.570 --> 00:00:54.630
but the reason you point
the fire extinguisher

00:00:54.630 --> 00:00:55.950
at the base of the flame

00:00:55.950 --> 00:00:58.410
is to literally suffocate the flame,

00:00:58.410 --> 00:01:00.570
and when you're shooting
it at a person's face,

00:01:00.570 --> 00:01:02.490
you're essentially suffocating
the person as well.

00:01:02.490 --> 00:01:03.930
See, the dangerous part would be

00:01:03.930 --> 00:01:06.180
if he was knocked unconscious
'cause then he wouldn't

00:01:06.180 --> 00:01:07.592
be able to climb outta the car.

00:01:07.592 --> 00:01:11.100
(suspenseful music)

00:01:11.100 --> 00:01:13.860
