(mouse clicking)

00:01:17.132 --> 00:01:19.020
(suspenseful music)

00:01:19.020 --> 00:01:21.000
Oh, he must've burned his hand.

00:01:21.000 --> 00:01:24.000
Burns to the hand are so bad
because of the contractors

00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:25.860
that can form, that the
skin essentially starts

00:01:25.860 --> 00:01:27.180
becoming flex,
(air whooshing)

