(mouse clicking)

00:01:50.010 --> 00:01:52.320
160 miles an hour?

00:01:52.320 --> 00:01:54.360
And how is he not concussed going

00:01:54.360 --> 00:01:57.510
from 160 miles an hour to zero so quickly?

00:01:57.510 --> 00:01:59.340
The danger in crashes is going

00:01:59.340 --> 00:02:02.760
from a high speed to a
zero speed because all

00:02:02.760 --> 00:02:05.640
of that inertia carries your
organs forward, even the brain.

00:02:05.640 --> 00:02:08.490
The brain sits in a soup, so
it starts hitting the front

00:02:08.490 --> 00:02:10.470
of your scalp when you
come to an abrupt stop,

00:02:10.470 --> 00:02:12.600
and I know they have
neck-stabilizing devices

00:02:12.600 --> 00:02:13.433
in the car, but whoa.

00:02:13.433 --> 00:02:14.940
- [Narrator] And he's
insisting, "No, no, no, no,

00:02:14.940 --> 00:02:16.890
we'll, we'll get the ambulance here,"

00:02:16.890 --> 00:02:19.920
but he wanted to demonstrate
that he was okay.

00:02:19.920 --> 00:02:21.420
He got a message to everyone,

00:02:21.420 --> 00:02:23.128
his wife and family in particular, that-

00:02:23.128 --> 00:02:24.840
(mouse clicking)
- Okay, beautiful message.

00:02:24.840 --> 00:02:26.340
Medically, I hate it.

00:02:26.340 --> 00:02:29.130
Adrenaline in moments like
this is rushing so fast

00:02:29.130 --> 00:02:30.450
that you might not have any idea

00:02:30.450 --> 00:02:31.620
what's going on in your body.

00:02:31.620 --> 00:02:33.090
You might be bleeding internally.

00:02:33.090 --> 00:02:34.830
You might be bleeding
internally into your skull,

00:02:34.830 --> 00:02:35.760
having a stroke.

00:02:35.760 --> 00:02:37.680
So many things could be
going wrong right now,

00:02:37.680 --> 00:02:41.070
and just to symbolize that
you're great and strong,

00:02:41.070 --> 00:02:42.510
you do the extra walk?

00:02:42.510 --> 00:02:45.030
Unnecessary. Actually, it's
the same reason in boxing.

00:02:45.030 --> 00:02:46.740
Once there's a knockout,
they don't have people

00:02:46.740 --> 00:02:49.380
just usually stand up right
away after the matches.

00:02:49.380 --> 00:02:50.880
They first bring them to a stool.

00:02:50.880 --> 00:02:52.470
They have them calm down in the stool,

00:02:52.470 --> 00:02:53.910
and they evaluate what's going on there,

00:02:53.910 --> 00:02:55.230
and they have the doctor speak with them.

00:02:55.230 --> 00:02:57.540
Then they have them stand
up, and they redo it again,

00:02:57.540 --> 00:02:59.280
and there's reasons for this progression,

00:02:59.280 --> 00:03:00.960
because we wanna make sure that the body

00:03:00.960 --> 00:03:02.310
and mind are both safe.
(mouse clicking)

